    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so loud lately. i mean not even literally, just everything. the lights, the people, the way my own brain won't shut up. it’s like constant static in my head and i just cant breathe through it anymore. i just want it all to be quiet. like, truly, completely quiet. i'm so tired of trying to cope with it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
